    "body": "Fetch uses `<a for=/>environment</a>` and that works without warning. I don't really know how `link-defaults` works. Intuitively I'd say that what you have ought to do the trick, but maybe you're running into https://tabatkins.github.io/bikeshed/#ambi-for? (I tend to avoid `link-defaults` and the like, instead \"hardcoding\" it for every reference.)",
