    "updated_at": "2022-11-21T01:39:08Z",
    "body": "HTML has a *lot* of definitions Bikeshed should not know about. All of them, by default. We explicitly mark up the ones we want people to use externally, by using data-export or data-dfn-type or other parts of the Bikeshed contract.\r\n\r\nWe'd prefer if we were able to use the standard dfn element without it being a sign that Bikeshed should index. We will use Bikeshed's data- attributes, when we want Bikeshed's involvement.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
